{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","externalID":"s:9Traversal21DepthFirstSearchEventO","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Traversal"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"SearchEvents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Traversal\/SearchEvents.swift#L25"},"role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A vertex is discovered, then every edge out of it is reported once per copy, then it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"finished. An edge to an undiscovered vertex is a tree edge, and the search continues from that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex before the next edge. An edge to a vertex discovered but not yet finished is a back"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge; a self-loop is one. An edge to a finished vertex is a forward edge when that vertex was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"discovered later than the edge’s source (a descendant; a repeated tree edge is one), and a cross"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge otherwise."}]}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What a depth-first search reports, in order, with the classification of CLRS §22.3."}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/backEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/crossEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/discover(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/finish(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/forwardEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/treeEdge(_:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SQ","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SH","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/traversal\/depthfirstsearchevent"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent"},"references":{"doc://Traversal/documentation/Traversal/DepthFirstSearchEvent/crossEdge(_:)":{"title":"DepthFirstSearchEvent.crossEdge(_:)","type":"topic","